    text: "focus: Hours after the recognition, the Sage's analytical precision and mystical intuition expand into universal computation and memory, completing his transformation into the living manifestation of synthesis."
  - line: 25
    type: narration
    text: "continuity: Hours after scene 023.1"
  - line: 26
